
Welcome. This little night walk shows everything arc_image can do: pictures that follow you, a room too plain for one, darkness with a scene of its own, and a picture that changes before your eyes. Head north, trust the lantern you find on the way, and when the dark finally offers you a bed, SLEEP. Interpreter authors: the source file carries the walkthrough, with the expected picture at every step.

The Demo of Rabenstein
An arc_image demonstration by Stefan Vogt
Release 1 / Serial number 260825 / Arcturus 1.13 (Cosmos 1.16)

You are standing on a path deep in the Black Forest, extending further north from here. On a night like this, the trees cast eerie shadows and people disappear without ever being seen again.

